  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TZA Research Cooperation with COSTECH 2025-2029 - TZA PRV Research Cooperation 2025-2029</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TZA Research Cooperation with COSTECH 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka och konsolidera kapacitet inom forskning, forskningskommunikation och innovation genom st&#xf6;d till COSTECHs verksamhet inom inkluderande och h&#xe5;llbar utveckling, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade system och milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r forskning, utbildning och innovation, samt st&#xe4;rkt genomslag f&#xf6;r forskningsresultat som adresserar samh&#xe4;lleliga behov. Programmet inneh&#xe5;ller tre tematiska delprogram: forskningsst&#xf6;d till klimatanpassning, st&#xe4;rkt forskningskommunikation och innovation och immaterialr&#xe4;tt.  Delprogrammet forskningsst&#xf6;d till klimatanpassning samfinansieras med Norad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Programme is to strengthen and consolidate capacities in research, research communication and innovation by supporting COSTECH&apos;s activities in inclusive and sustainable development, improved systems and environment for research, education and innovation, and enhanced impact of research results addressing societal needs. The program contains three thematic sub-programmes for research support for climate adaptation, strengthened research communication and innovation and intellectual property rights. The sub-programme on research support for climate adaptation is co-financed with Norad.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the contribution is to strengthen and consolidate capacities in research, research communication and innovation by supporting COSTECH&apos;s activities in inclusive and sustainable development, improved systems and environment for research, education and innovation, and enhanced impact of research results addressing societal needs. The program contains three thematic sub-programmes for research support for climate adaptation, strengthened research communication and innovation and intellectual property rights. The sub-programme on research support for climate adaptation is co-financed with Norad.</narrative>
  </description>
